Reedsy Learning  is our online publishing school, with over 50 courses and over 200,000 students to date. More recently, we introduced How to Write a Novel, a masterclass to help authors complete their novel in just 3 months.

We’re looking for a Community Intern to assist the Reedsy Learning team with managing our community of writers, as well as promoting the course and events. You will learn about community building, email outreach, influencer campaigns, and growth marketing.

In your internship, you will:

Identify and contact new leads for affiliate and influencer outreach;

Manage communication with our influencers and affiliates;

Engage with students and moderate chat spaces on our custom community app (Circle);

Help moderate live webinars; and

Generate ideas for introducing our course and events to new audiences.

Requirements

We’re looking for someone with:

Analytical mind;

Experience identifying audiences and targeting them with marketing campaigns;

Experience with community management;

Good understanding of Google Suite;

Strong writing skills;

Native-level English speaker;

