Background in creative writing and/or growth marketing;

A desire to initiate and act on your own ideas;

Proven experience in managing communities and scaling acquisition for a startup or a fast-growing company;

Fluent in multiple languages. Reedsy welcomes applicants of all cultures and backgrounds;

